  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>本模组专为受够用红石代替血液的玩家打造！立即下载，对抗这种荒谬设定！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您可以将本模组纳入您的整合包或其他项目，无需申请授权。只需在项目中添加本页面链接并声明非原创即可。任何评测都将备受感激，甚至可能展示在此页面。祝您游玩愉快！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23;text-decoration:underline\">通过成为赞助者支持我的创作：</span></em></strong></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><em><strong><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://patreon.com/HorrorElementmodsupport?utm_medium=unknown&amp;utm_source=join_link&amp;utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&amp;utm_content=copyLink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/496520/description_a34fa755-2c41-4ae9-ba62-5daa6251ac01.png\"></a></strong></em></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><strong>或加入Discord服务器获取最新动态！</strong></em></span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/P4aZmpFMcc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/602618/description_f0df218c-74d9-4b6f-b467-407b5e7cab2d.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"110\"></strong></em></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一直渴望真正的恐怖模组？恐怖元素模组为您而生！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组兼容创造与生存模式。无论是为地图增添细节，还是在生存模式中遭遇恐怖元素与结构，皆可满足您的需求。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/770QExz.png\"></strong></em></span></p><h2><em><img src=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horror-elements-mod/settings/Images/Teaser projet Predator Hunting grounds mod.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><strong>禁用氛围方块的指令：</strong></em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>&nbsp;/HMdayreset true/false</strong></em></span></h2><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">当前模组包含：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -60+种会在生存世界生成的恐怖主题元素</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -10+种独特方块为作品增添氛围（闪烁灯光、红灯笼、音效方块等）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -7种随机生成的世界结构</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;恐怖元素模组将持续更新新功能...</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">安装步骤：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1：下载与模组版本对应的Forge</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2：按Win+R键并输入%appdata%</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3：点击\"roaming\"文件夹后进入\".minecraft\"文件夹</span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4：将下载的模组文件放入\"mods\"文件夹</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5：在启动器中选择Forge版本并启动游戏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">6：尽情体验恐惧</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n（注：保留所有HTML标签及图片链接不变，仅对文本内容进行本地化翻译，采用符合中文阅读习惯的短句结构和情感化表达，如使用感叹号增强号召力，将\"blood\"意译为\"血液\"以保持游戏语境，并对技术操作步骤使用更符合中文用户习惯的表述方式）",
